betterquesting.questline.GTNotLeisureQuestsLinQ.name=GT: Science Not Leisure
betterquesting.questline.GTNotLeisureQuestsLinQ.desc=This is fun, but not leisure.

betterquesting.questline.GTNotLeisure75SteamAgQ.name=Tier 0.75 - Superheated Steam Age
betterquesting.questline.GTNotLeisure75SteamAgQ.desc=Making new discoveries...

betterquesting.questline.GTNotLeisure99SteamAgQ.name=Tier 0.999... - Supercritical Steam Age
betterquesting.questline.GTNotLeisure99SteamAgQ.desc=Pushing steam to its absolute limits!

betterquesting.quest.1h93HjX3SxKrBr52ggnf4g.name=Rock Breaking
betterquesting.quest.1h93HjX3SxKrBr52ggnf4g.desc=To feed your Extractinator, you'll need lots and lots of stone...
betterquesting.quest.1kW_s8JBTQGAoDk5TwT_Sg.name=Crafting Innovation
betterquesting.quest.1kW_s8JBTQGAoDk5TwT_Sg.desc=Keep improving your productivity!
betterquesting.quest.8W8GpVb0T3OKjeij5wMPIA.name=Steam Cracker
betterquesting.quest.8W8GpVb0T3OKjeij5wMPIA.desc=Steam-crack your oil and gas, with a small loss.%n%nReminder: you can already craft LV input hatches, so check the Steam Manufacturer recipes!
betterquesting.quest.aqKUKicyTSinNsSU-wH1Kg.name=Large Steam Circuit Assembler
betterquesting.quest.aqKUKicyTSinNsSU-wH1Kg.desc=Keep in mind that this multiblock comes with its own cleanroom.
betterquesting.quest.ATkJffCmSJaXa3SnUdVAYg.name=Phew!
betterquesting.quest.ATkJffCmSJaXa3SnUdVAYg.desc=[warn]Careful, it's hot![/warn]
betterquesting.quest.buN0i7l0Sh6yIoY2SuQ6xg.name=The Second Multiblock Revolution
betterquesting.quest.buN0i7l0Sh6yIoY2SuQ6xg.desc=Raise your head and welcome the second multiblock revolution.
betterquesting.quest.CamVAtIAR82Jo-QqMm3hWg.name=A Song of Brick and Clay
betterquesting.quest.CamVAtIAR82Jo-QqMm3hWg.desc=Nobody likes collecting clay. Let's see if we can make it a little more fun.%n%nGenetically modify a Rainforest Oak Sapling.
betterquesting.quest.daqbs2zKSWGpkkG35kJMEA.name=Clay Compound Ingot
betterquesting.quest.daqbs2zKSWGpkkG35kJMEA.desc=Clay Compound will become a key material for hydraulic components and many machine casings later on.
betterquesting.quest.fa0WLxHoSmatfQO3rB_tuA.name=Just a Building Block
betterquesting.quest.fa0WLxHoSmatfQO3rB_tuA.desc=This is just a building block for multiblock structures.%n%n§3Its recipe is different from the vanilla Brick Bronze Shell recipe, so don't mix them up.
betterquesting.quest.Gh5xxqjHQgiN5Vj7bzgERw.name=Stronze Ingot
betterquesting.quest.Gh5xxqjHQgiN5Vj7bzgERw.desc=Stronze is an alloy of bronze and steel made in an [note]Alloy Smelter[/note].%n%nIt can be used to make larger fluid pipes and better tools.
betterquesting.quest.HvNhtAdzSVG2FszcnND8HQ.name=Credits
betterquesting.quest.HvNhtAdzSVG2FszcnND8HQ.desc=Ported from the 3.0.0 update by%n%n[warn]Potato2022[/warn]%n%n%n%n%n%nQuests updated by%n%n[note]LineBroke[/note]
betterquesting.quest.i2i03vbcSUuy2L58qwoAuA.name=Carpentry
betterquesting.quest.i2i03vbcSUuy2L58qwoAuA.desc=Processing wood is annoying, and you haven't found a way to automate it... until now.%n%nSome structure blocks for the Steam Woodcutter must be made with this machine.
betterquesting.quest.I97UUD3oRdWn8Wk-hr6nIg.name=Cactus Wonder
betterquesting.quest.I97UUD3oRdWn8Wk-hr6nIg.desc=Currying favor from ancient cactus deities is certainly one way to produce steam.
betterquesting.quest.JFy8X-g-Q66FGJvxcJoQpw.name=Sluice Extractination
betterquesting.quest.JFy8X-g-Q66FGJvxcJoQpw.desc=To meet the metal demands of your ever-growing factory, look to the Extractinator. This machine can process sluices made in the Large Steam Mixer and turn them into resources.%n[note]%nOnly gem sluice recipes are visible in NEI.%n%nThat's fine; check the recipes here.[/note]%n
betterquesting.quest.KDqBdJabSTqDFoV6DcWcwA.name=Store Everything
betterquesting.quest.KDqBdJabSTqDFoV6DcWcwA.desc=The Drawer Controller has been moved down into the Steam Age.%n%nLikewise, drawer upgrades of every tier are now cheaper.
betterquesting.quest.KMcnrzdoQA2OHibv6cxrGQ.name=High-Pressure Steam Assembler
betterquesting.quest.KMcnrzdoQA2OHibv6cxrGQ.desc=The High-Pressure Steam Assembler can run LV voltage recipes.
betterquesting.quest.LqjbONytQbGbqbczYyR4dg.name=Turn Up the Heat
betterquesting.quest.LqjbONytQbGbqbczYyR4dg.desc=The Updraft Kiln can conveniently produce firebricks, wrought iron, Brick Bronze Shells, and more.%n%n[note]You should already be able to make a water reservoir. Check its crafting table recipe.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.mC6_hr7yTOKllBrvuYzNpg.name=High-Precision Processing
betterquesting.quest.mC6_hr7yTOKllBrvuYzNpg.desc=This will be one of the machines you use most often.%n%n[note]It can run MV voltage recipes.%n%nYou can use a doll instead of structure glass; it counts as MAX-tier glass.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.nwimqpl7TsGuK57C6LQVyQ.name=Wireless Steam Network
betterquesting.quest.nwimqpl7TsGuK57C6LQVyQ.desc=You've been having strange visions lately... spires of gears and valves, spinning in an endless dance.%n%nIn these visions, you see many technologies, but you do not fully understand them.%n%nYou can create them, though. Pipeless steam... if such a thing were possible, you could accomplish almost anything.%n%n%n%n[note]Using a pipeless steam hatch will create a pipeless network, similar to a "wireless network", whatever that means.%n%nIf you're in multiplayer, you may want to know these commands:%n%n/steam_networkdisplay <member>%n%n/steam_networkjoin <member to add> <team member>%n%n/steam_networkadd <member> <amount>%n%n/steam_networkset <member> <amount>[/note]
betterquesting.quest.O1LcPUEiRY2uT33NvIX7lg.name=Instant Smelting
betterquesting.quest.O1LcPUEiRY2uT33NvIX7lg.desc=An extremely powerful furnace unlocked as early as the Stone Age. It requires no fuel. Later, you may want to upgrade to the Large Steam Furnace; it is even stronger.%n%n[warn]Do not put in too much coal or too many furnaces.[/warn]
betterquesting.quest.Ovh7jTzAQzGPV47TutmI7g.name=Ore Processing
betterquesting.quest.Ovh7jTzAQzGPV47TutmI7g.desc=Ore processing, easy as pie.%n%n[note]You may not need to build a full ore processing line just yet. Take a look at the Steam Ore Processing Module.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.ozk09ALiS9qGZwOfrmesdw.name=Greater Steam Throughput
betterquesting.quest.ozk09ALiS9qGZwOfrmesdw.desc=Extra-large steam hatches to satisfy the steam demands of these steam-hungry beasts.%n%nLater, you will also unlock pipeless steam hatches.
betterquesting.quest.PAEAFa5xShavUK6dZgq45Q.name=Superheating
betterquesting.quest.PAEAFa5xShavUK6dZgq45Q.desc=By building a massive pressure chamber out of Stronze machine casings, you can combine steam with flammable liquids and heat it to even higher temperatures.
betterquesting.quest.RxBRozZvTD2jKO14rgc-Qg.name=Primitive Distillation Tower
betterquesting.quest.RxBRozZvTD2jKO14rgc-Qg.desc=At this point you should already have steel, so... just build a primitive distillation tower. Uga buga.%n%nReminder: you can already craft LV input hatches, so check the Steam Manufacturer recipes!%n%n[note]Keep in mind that this machine can only output 6 fluids.%n%nEach layer needs one output hatch.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.ryXkmJDfRKuEZdjrMQfcfw.name=The Unmatched Power of the Sun
betterquesting.quest.ryXkmJDfRKuEZdjrMQfcfw.desc=Who doesn't like solar boilers? This gigantic boiler will produce plenty of steam for your growing enterprise. Unlike ordinary boilers, it never calcifies and never explodes. Just add water!
betterquesting.quest.s6IjiKarS2qm9RpaPHLz6A.name=Mass Production
betterquesting.quest.s6IjiKarS2qm9RpaPHLz6A.desc=Tired of making casings and motors by hand? This machine can help!%n%n[note]Don't forget to check the cheaper recipes unlocked by the Steam Manufacturer![/note]
betterquesting.quest.Thn62VlIRL2opp_oKxQanw.name=Blending
betterquesting.quest.Thn62VlIRL2opp_oKxQanw.desc=The Large Steam Mixer is the only machine §maside from those cursed electric abominations...§r that acts as a mixer. This ability will open many doors for you!%n%n[note]Place a stainless steel gear in the controller to unlock HV voltage recipes.%n%nYou can use a doll instead of structure glass; it counts as MAX-tier glass.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.u7m6xZO3QUGqnW5oAd-liQ.name=Precision Components
betterquesting.quest.u7m6xZO3QUGqnW5oAd-liQ.desc=You will need these to make more steam multiblock machines.
betterquesting.quest.uJwv3ePjStO4txPiOWlEZg.name=Breel Ingot
betterquesting.quest.uJwv3ePjStO4txPiOWlEZg.desc=Breel is an alloy of bronze and steel made in a [note]Mixer[/note].%n%nIt can be used to make larger item pipes and better tools.
betterquesting.quest.Wl2Do2ocSTamZzrRADtxgw.name=Regrowth
betterquesting.quest.Wl2Do2ocSTamZzrRADtxgw.desc=No more chopping down trees.
betterquesting.quest.Xq2Kd5VGTNOc4Rraviu2_A.name=Casting
betterquesting.quest.Xq2Kd5VGTNOc4Rraviu2_A.desc=Alloying is getting slow in those tiny alloy smelters of yours. You're due for an upgrade.%n%n[note]The Large Steam Alloy Smelter can perform recipes that require too much steam for a normal alloy smelter to handle, as well as recipes with more than 2 inputs.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.ZMgNkjXwQ5ec0KVhJ9o63w.name=A Better Blast Furnace...
betterquesting.quest.ZMgNkjXwQ5ec0KVhJ9o63w.desc=An automatable blast furnace. Time to start mass-producing steel ingots!
betterquesting.quest.zUqM918XQA-LSJIeixqzhQ.name=You'll Love This
betterquesting.quest.zUqM918XQA-LSJIeixqzhQ.desc=You thought you could escape component crafting just because we're staying in the Steam Age? Don't be silly.%n%n§3Some components have powerful logistics abilities. Let your imagination run wild and put them to use.
betterquesting.quest._UQG839BQ6mf7b6evuVeAg.name=Classic Coke Oven
betterquesting.quest._UQG839BQ6mf7b6evuVeAg.desc=More steam all the time... aren't you just sick of it? This powerful coke oven will produce enough coke and creosote oil for a lifetime, hopefully.
betterquesting.quest.eHaeoPROSSWmX6tTXJaX5w.name=Welcome to Tier 0.75
betterquesting.quest.eHaeoPROSSWmX6tTXJaX5w.desc=If you're an experienced GTNH player, everything up to this point may feel familiar. But now things are different. Since you have chosen the righteous path of steam over "electricity", steam will reveal many wonders to you...

betterquesting.quest.BdHm2_HDS4uOxUSUYwajBA.name=Jetstream
betterquesting.quest.BdHm2_HDS4uOxUSUYwajBA.desc=By harnessing the power of a strange hidden plane of reality known as the §dJetstream§r, you can greatly accelerate pipeless networks.
betterquesting.quest.fjwET1ucR3e0Av-WtmjNEA.name=Steam?... Rocket?
betterquesting.quest.fjwET1ucR3e0Av-WtmjNEA.desc=Yes.%n%n[note]Replaces the T1 rocket.[/note]
betterquesting.quest.ftAZh6RtRQ-EQ3depF4aGw.name=Black-Hole-Like Power
betterquesting.quest.ftAZh6RtRQ-EQ3depF4aGw.desc=No Description
betterquesting.quest.gzYyMQDZQW6nF7h-U4z4Dg.name=Lava Forever
betterquesting.quest.gzYyMQDZQW6nF7h-U4z4Dg.desc=If you want to keep increasing the temperature of your steam, you may need a way to produce lava.%n%nThe Super Stone Heater can take stone and steam to create oceans of the stuff!
betterquesting.quest.ue-xXmztS-eygeHNU2km_w.name=Steam Elevator
betterquesting.quest.ue-xXmztS-eygeHNU2km_w.desc=No Description
betterquesting.quest.wFq8INB3R3e-2RfQ4VS3fA.name=Steam Item Vault
betterquesting.quest.wFq8INB3R3e-2RfQ4VS3fA.desc=It can hold a lot. But you may need AE before you can use it conveniently.
betterquesting.quest.F8kpJGKLR2i1taFBEEQ7DQ.name=Advanced Hydraulic Components
betterquesting.quest.F8kpJGKLR2i1taFBEEQ7DQ.desc=Some kind of advanced component... you do not even fully understand what it does. But it is powerful.
betterquesting.quest.9AR6cFFdTZmSTXNewYnGPw.name=Beacon
betterquesting.quest.9AR6cFFdTZmSTXNewYnGPw.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It wants to be fed. It wants to create. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device will require calibration... it will seek its kin... we must help it find them...
betterquesting.quest.BOWDVT5YQcOzjteLg6VPkQ.name=Beacon Block
betterquesting.quest.BOWDVT5YQcOzjteLg6VPkQ.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device is almost ready... release it.
betterquesting.quest.X020oIz9SCiiJhbmCGmLtQ.name=Beacon Upgrade
betterquesting.quest.X020oIz9SCiiJhbmCGmLtQ.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device will recognize its kin by their brand... we will connect the device to its allies... it will be satisfied...
betterquesting.quest.mJ4z0kDxSO-dsZtZ5BOMvQ.name=Compressed Steam
betterquesting.quest.mJ4z0kDxSO-dsZtZ5BOMvQ.desc=Using your Super Compressor, you can make pure steam ingots, which somehow remain solid. Instead of questioning the logic, why not try making some fluid pipes?%n%n%n%nCompressed Steam is a better material than Stronze for fluid pipes, multiblock hatches, and multiblock buses!
betterquesting.quest.3QfgXMVkTwyZTuuRKJgCKw.name=Core Crystal
betterquesting.quest.3QfgXMVkTwyZTuuRKJgCKw.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device will require energy... pulsing, glowing, endless...
betterquesting.quest.d1lb3xB9T-G5sS47GLYcEQ.name=Endgame Steam Generation
betterquesting.quest.d1lb3xB9T-G5sS47GLYcEQ.desc=Is this really necessary? (Yes.)
betterquesting.quest.LaMMK-_LTE-sNUjubbQZgQ.name=Frame
betterquesting.quest.LaMMK-_LTE-sNUjubbQZgQ.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device will churn, mesh, and grind... the device will work, the device will think...
betterquesting.quest.aEoijugLS7G7R1qPnNXMZg.name=Infinite Creation
betterquesting.quest.aEoijugLS7G7R1qPnNXMZg.desc=This device... is this what you dreamed of? Is it a vision or a nightmare? What strange purpose could this towering behemoth serve? Sometimes you stay up late drawing blueprints and flowcharts, desperately trying to understand how it actually works.%n%n%n%nMaybe you must build it first before you can truly understand.
betterquesting.quest.md1HW0pQQ2OhgonRAL4joA.name=Iris Blade
betterquesting.quest.md1HW0pQQ2OhgonRAL4joA.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device will draw danger... the device's enemies will seek us, and will inflict pain upon the device...
betterquesting.quest.n2WTjOt3TBK8X2b2W6TLZA.name=Iris Upgrade
betterquesting.quest.n2WTjOt3TBK8X2b2W6TLZA.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device's enemies are powerful... they will seek, they will find, they will destroy... the device must protect itself...
betterquesting.quest.NbqZdOqbRuG8Xv-KYCajbA.name=Plate
betterquesting.quest.NbqZdOqbRuG8Xv-KYCajbA.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device will ache, burn, and suffer... we must soothe it, we must control it...
betterquesting.quest.4rdyNXpwQLG6n1QdWRK9JA.name=Outer Ring Block
betterquesting.quest.4rdyNXpwQLG6n1QdWRK9JA.desc=Ever since you built the Perfect Steam Progenitor, your nights have become more restless. You think the machine is speaking to you—in a language that is not yours, yet you can understand it. It has a design it wants to share with you...%n%n%n%n§oThe device will enter this world in the shape of a ring, inscribed upon time and space...
betterquesting.quest.b5qQ79exTKGqlpoaJrdCfQ.name=Supercritical Steam
betterquesting.quest.b5qQ79exTKGqlpoaJrdCfQ.desc=To progress further, you need to make an even hotter kind of steam...%n%n%n%nYou have three choices for producing §csupercritical§r steam. You can use more creosote oil in the Hyper Pressure Reactor to upgrade §6superheated§r steam again, produce it directly from lava and water, or ask the elusive cactus deities for a favor through the §2Cactus Wonder§r.
betterquesting.quest.5BjWblhEQuaPM0FR8og1Pw.name=Thanks for Using These Quests
betterquesting.quest.5BjWblhEQuaPM0FR8og1Pw.desc=Give me my poisonous potato and we're good to go.
betterquesting.quest.4b1deRqfQ9ibu3FXSMQH4Q.name=Steam Gate
betterquesting.quest.4b1deRqfQ9ibu3FXSMQH4Q.desc=An engineering marvel made of countless gears and pipes, harnessing some force you are not entirely sure of.%n%n%n%nAs you gaze upon your creation, think... was it worth it?%n%n
betterquesting.quest.xNqiQ98pTSyopIdUBOWdmQ.name=Welcome to Tier 0.999...
betterquesting.quest.xNqiQ98pTSyopIdUBOWdmQ.desc=It's time to put everything to the test.

betterquesting.quest.-kQ2srGLRiuKqqMSq-h_7Q.name=Storage Input Series
betterquesting.quest.-kQ2srGLRiuKqqMSq-h_7Q.desc=Keep in mind that upgraded hatches can set their pull amount with middle-click.
