betterquesting.quest.4fdxxto5RlywdrL3H6kVSg.name=Stay Away from Hunger
betterquesting.quest.4fdxxto5RlywdrL3H6kVSg.desc=Crazy Thursday. Send me 50 Technician Coins.%n%n%nRing of Satiety:%n%nCan be worn in a Bauble ring slot.%n%nAfter wearing it, every tick it grants level 255 Saturation for 10s and level 255 Night Vision for 60s, while also filling your hunger and saturation.
betterquesting.quest.4Ug6fhxWS2K0g8LT4GPoiw.name=More Machines
betterquesting.quest.4Ug6fhxWS2K0g8LT4GPoiw.desc=No Description
betterquesting.quest.5-sI2VYqSyWe7HavISg6yQ.name=Parallel Control Hatch
betterquesting.quest.5-sI2VYqSyWe7HavISg6yQ.desc=The Wireless Upgrade Chip is your final goal.
